Recommends: ankh-de-fonts, ankh-de-cursors, ankh-de-gtk
Description: Windows 11 geometry, Ankh colours, on KDE Plasma 6
 Ankh DE gives KDE Plasma 6 the metrics, typography, materials, motion and
 shell layout of Windows 11, checked by a measurement bench, in the graphite
 and violet identity of Ankh.
 .
 It is not a desktop environment written from scratch, not a Windows 11 clone,
 and not affiliated with Microsoft: no Windows file is shipped. Only the
 measurements are reused, from sources Microsoft publishes under the MIT
 licence.
